/data/
node_modules/
.DS_Store
# mojulo.ai site — its own repo, not part of the substrate
/site/
# Maintainer's private working-tree ledger. Agents operating mojulo orient via
# forward_context (runtime MCP); repo-dev orientation is CLAUDE.md + CHANGELOG.
/docs/STATUS.md
# Plans and spike output live in lite-template/integration/ (CLAUDE.md, "Plans and changelog").
# The tracked chatbot runtime that lived beside it left with the chatbot factory in 3.0.0, taking
# its own .gitignore along. A checkout that ran it still holds what that file ignored (the bot's
# .env with provider keys, data/conversation.db with end-user transcripts, the ONNX model, a
# lockfile, logs); ignoring the whole folder keeps those, and the plan folder, out of a `git add`.
/lite-template/
